00:00:00,999 --> 00:00:07,620
Hi, I am Shweta, currently pursuing my second year in Cyber Security at Shreeshwar College of Engineering.

2
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:13,320
I come from the humble background and I am proud to be the first generation college student in my family.

3
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:20,379
My journey so far has been filled with curiosity, learning and strong desire to make an impact in the tech world.

4
00:00:21,219 --> 00:00:29,480
What drew me to the Career Academy is its vision of empowering first generation students like me to grow, learn and find direction in the tech industry.

5
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:36,759
I believe this program will not only help me to build technical skills but also shape my mindset for success.

6
00:00:37,579 --> 00:00:43,859
One of my biggest challenges was adapting to college life and catching up with rapidly evolving technology.

7
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:51,579
Coming from the background, with limited experience in coding, I initially found it difficult to keep pace with my peers.

8
00:00:52,359 --> 00:00:54,479
However, I stay determined.

9
00:00:54,479 --> 00:01:01,719
I enjoyed in online classes, practiced through projects and reached out to seniors for guidance.

10
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:08,239
Over time, I built my confidence and developed my genuine passion on problem solving.

11
00:01:08,579 --> 00:01:16,459
I am truly excited for the opportunity to learn and grow along with dedicated mentors and like-minded students.

12
